    "body": "Record the merged selected-pair CUDA contextual-credit implementation and its executed validation in current-state. The entry distinguishes the retained full-bank objective and exact native anchors from host preparation, diagnostic timings, and unmeasured learning/whole-fit performance. It links #1833, records the independently audited second completed matched pair, and preserves the six immutable fits and their next decision. Four of six arms have finished; the final pair remains running/queued, so no three-order policy verdict is asserted.\n\nDocumentation only, based directly on main after #1833 landed. At exact head `e14586e8c5cd54897f6bbf3b8cf109716e037905`, `python3 scripts/check_claim_wording.py` and `git diff --check` pass. The three changed code blobs in merge `5bc6f31ea32cb680f9eb6814051190dd485e50a7` were separately checked equal to tested head `c0949cef01ecc48fc65da0a6180cedb152c7fbb5`. No additional model, CUDA or Rust code is changed by this record.\n\nReferences #820.\n",
